s9-4-p2 = prose (cons "C is the primary target presentation. A represented program, or a specialization of its evaluator at known inputs, is lowered to C together with its relation to the source interpretation. An existing C compiler then supplies the target instruction selection, object representation, and executable construction. The language, kernel, and network do not require independent direct emitters for every processor architecture." nil)
